hadiths[28]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1811","Malik related to me from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1812","Malik related to me from Suhayl ibn Abu Salih from his father from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1813","Malik related to me from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1814","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said that Isa ibn Maryam encountered a pig on the road. He said to it"
"1815","Malik related to me from Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Alqama from his father from Bilal ibn al-Harith al-Muzani that the Messenger of Allah"
"1816","Malik related to me from Abdullah ibn Dinar that Abu Salih as- Samman informed him that Abu Hurayra said"
"1817","Malik related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1818","Malik related to me that he heard that Isa ibn Maryam used to say"
"1819","Malik related to me that he heard that A'isha"
"1820","Malik related to me from al-Walid ibn Abdullah ibn Sayyad that al-Muttalib ibn Abdullah ibn Hantab al-Makhzumi informed him that a man asked the Messenger of Allah"
"1821","Malik related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1822","Malik related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam from his father that Umar ibn al-Khattab came upon Abu Bakr as-Siddiq pulling his tongue. Umar said to him"
"1823","Malik related to me from Abdullah ibn Dinar saying"
"1824","Malik related to me from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1825","Malik related to me from Safwan ibn Sulaym that a man asked the Messenger of Allah"
"1826","Malik related to me that he heard that Abdullah ibn Masud used to say"
"1827","Malik related to me that he heard that someone said to Luqman"
"1828","Malik related to me that he heard that Abdullah ibn Masud used to say"
"1829","Malik related to me that Safwan ibn Sulaym said"
"1830","Malik related to me from Suhayl ibn Abi Salih from his father from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1831","Malik related to me from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1832","Malik related to me that he had heard that Umm Salama"
"1833","Malik related to me that Ismail ibn Abi Hakim heard Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz say"
"1834","Malik related to me from Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha that Anas ibn Malik said"
"1835","Malik said"
"1836","Malik related to me that Amir ibn Abdullah ibn az-Zubayr would stop speaking when he heard thunder and say"
"1837","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab from Urwa ibn az-Zubayr from A'isha"
"1838","Malik related to me from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"